# NOTE: public/llms.txt and public/llms-full.txt are generated by
# scripts/sync-llms.mjs but are deliberately COMMITTED, not ignored — the
# deploy pipeline is external to this repo and may not run the prebuild
# hook, so the files must exist in the checkout. CI enforces they match the
# repo-root sources. Edit the repo-root llms.txt / llms-full.txt, then run
# `bun scripts/sync-llms.mjs` and commit the result.
